.superpowers/

# Third-party vendor documentation kept locally for research reference only
# (competitor guides, PDFs). Not ours to redistribute, and this repo is heading
# for public visibility — it must never enter history. See #265 (verify
# redistribution rights and shipped-component provenance). Birdbrain's own
# long-lived reference docs live in website/content/docs/, not here.
docs/reference/
.curator/

